      <slug></slug>
      <title>qt-project.org and Qt 5</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>CrossDesktop Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The Qt project was established in October to drive further development of&#xA;Qt as an open source project. The main development effort of&#xA;qt-project.org goes into Qt 5, the next major version of Qt that is&#xA;currently being developed. The talk will explain the setup of&#xA;qt-project.org, and how people can participate and contribute to the&#xA;project. It&amp;#39;ll also give an overview over Qt 5.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
